{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1296.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"ae69c07ca248132435d932c66111254b10aa853de42fd048b3955654add12e0e","ja":"ちょっと、ちょっと！　どうしたのよ！\n大きな声出して……もしかして、ケンカなの！？","zh":"等等，等等！怎么回事啊！\n这么大声……难道说，在吵架吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1296.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"03ecf046b26e6571e730db2cfa1d5b023b2869af766e250b601dd16c1aaf4384","ja":"り、莉緒さん！？　ケンカって……\nあ、もしかして、お芝居のことですか？","zh":"莉、莉绪姐！？吵架是……\n啊，难道说，是指演戏的事吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1296.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"92328f80155eed4f319b6866dc0e101732252c33e21253c3bb82c16d506e77b5","ja":"えっ、お芝居……？","zh":"诶，演戏……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1296.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"1319235479e07352d78f134014bb8f81acb2592c3f3e84228bfd63a19f875136","ja":"紗代子に時代劇のオファーがあったんだ。\nダンスバトルの殺陣を見た監督が、ぜひって。","zh":"有时代剧向纱代子发来了出演邀约。\n导演看了舞斗里的打戏，说务必要请她来。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1296.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"1faf51a497f093ab62ac6d192d9b62a150bab63851a49d52b80feeeeb2e5cecf","ja":"オレたちはその練習に付き合ってるんだ！","zh":"我们是在陪着做那个练习呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1296.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"942972386fc2061e0c09768922c23ea582f09a44b2bb007958aa9aea7123b113","ja":"そうだったの。\n練習の邪魔をしてちゃって、ごめんなさいね。","zh":"原来是这样啊。\n打扰到你练习了，真是不好意思呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1296.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"53db55579406f2ccec33fa3f148daf189302f3d7d29fb77b42fbc6270675ceb9","ja":"いえ。あの、それより莉緒さん！\n今って、お忙しいでしょうか？","zh":"没事的。那个，比起这个，莉绪小姐！\n您现在忙吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1296.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"3363c683bbe9032b233618a6cc4a75c54b878647689c31695df085c664fc9d21","ja":"もしよければ、莉緒さんにもぜひ、\nお芝居のお手伝いをお願いしたいんです！","zh":"如果方便的话，莉绪小姐也务必，\n来帮我们演这场戏吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
